"desc":"Welcome to canoe tripping at Camp Kandalore. Canoe trip is an integral part of Kandalore’s culture and experience. Every camper will go on a canoe trip during their stay, from an overnight for our youngest campers, up to a 24 whitewater wilderness expedition for our leaders. Canoe trips provide unmatched opportunities for campers to learn outdoor skills, work as a team, build resilience and make meaningful connections with nature and the people around us. A chance to learn new skills, to overcome challenges, to connect with nature in new ways. Our campers start canoe tripping in their first year at camp, and grow in skills as the years","photo":"https://www.kandalore.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/h-_0001s_0000s_0000_gate.png","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":8}]},{"name":"Summer Camp","desc":null,"photo":"https://www.kandalore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/DSC_1304-1-scaled-e1677617203519-500x334-1-e1733244376752.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":9}]},{"name":"Camp Site","desc":null,"photo":"https://www.kandalore.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/tripping-5.png","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":10}]},{"name":"2 Week Programs (ages 7-16)","desc":"Our 1 Week campers will live in a cabin with 7-9 other campers who are also in the 1 Week program. The follow the same daily routine as our 2 week campers, but will not have canoeing or swimming lessons each day. In this program, to make sure we can pack in as many fun activities as possible, we pre-plan our 1 week","photo":"https://www.kandalore.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/1706755.png","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":11}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","blurb":"Friends, laughter, campfires, songs, sunsets, and stars. The scent of pine. The sparkle of clear water. The dip of the paddle. Challenge yourself. Build confidence. Fin